      "jp": "散歩をしていると、言い争っているような声が聞こえた。\n気になって、声のする方をそっと覗き込むと――。",
      "jp_sha256": "7f38fe3090c8ca5d6acdd1251c64ab443ff237b08453a439fc053ef6317ccbcd",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "산책하던 중 말다툼하는 듯한 목소리가 들렸다.\n신경 쓰여 목소리가 나는 쪽을 살짝 들여다보자――.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e906b023611dfe70ce208122b4133c9bbe1f445607c1f7b2da358e2323e5e051:000002_5102256964758571102:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "散歩をしていると、言い争っているような声が聞こえた。\n気になって、声のする方をそっと覗き込むと――。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "6960a163dd519c83e61671c872d0301c53c76b177db9e7d58c43671632c1965c",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ランシャンさんとトンジャオさんが、\n凄い剣幕で顔を突き合わせていた。",
      "jp_sha256": "505ed3afd76a5e96c0bd99cda4d04075cb953460bf9180776bdf93e16c97730e",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "란샹 씨와 톤자오 씨가,\n엄청난 기세로 얼굴을 맞대고 있었다.",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 16,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e906b023611dfe70ce208122b4133c9bbe1f445607c1f7b2da358e2323e5e051:000002_5102256964758571102:g0:r15",
      "row_index_0based": 15,
      "serialized_row_index": 15,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ランシャンさんとトンジャオさんが、\n凄い剣幕で顔を突き合わせていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "0f8f28e05ef070c7607dc32d1d0b9af9df0b7bd7119e2216619622ac45b5e87b",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "静粛に。いったいどうしたのですか？\n何で争っているのかは知りませんが、私が判決を下しましょう。",
      "jp_sha256": "a88290ab039d8e1a6c105624026d05fdd9f5e2d0689e1d6d1bba30b6212ac592",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "정숙하십시오. 대체 무슨 일입니까?\n무엇 때문에 다투는지는 모르지만 제가 판결을 내리겠습니다.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 24,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e906b023611dfe70ce208122b4133c9bbe1f445607c1f7b2da358e2323e5e051:000002_5102256964758571102:g0:r23",
      "row_index_0based": 23,
      "serialized_row_index": 23,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "カガミヤ",
        "Emt2_Ang",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "静粛に。いったいどうしたのですか？\n何で争っているのかは知りませんが、私が判決を下しましょう。",
        "",
        "ch_10434/R18/10434A0_10434_Nml/10434A0_10434_001",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "カガミヤ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10434/R18/10434A0_10434_Nml/10434A0_10434_001"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "63e7ac13498c0ff5aef8b98d96ed350f614fe8052aef12b7c8817eb78fe5d4f9",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "私は遙か昔から、モンスター娘たちの争いを収めてきました。\n公平な判決を約束いたします。如何でしょうか？",
      "jp_sha256": "0d81ee1b97630f12e54d6ff3c6252f97b91c05e81e9a2b43023b6590b595fd06",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "저는 아주 오래전부터 몬스터 소녀들의 분쟁을 해결해 왔습니다.\n공정한 판결을 약속드리죠. 어떻습니까?",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 27,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e906b023611dfe70ce208122b4133c9bbe1f445607c1f7b2da358e2323e5e051:000002_5102256964758571102:g0:r26",
      "row_index_0based": 26,
      "serialized_row_index": 26,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "カガミヤ",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "私は遙か昔から、モンスター娘たちの争いを収めてきました。\n公平な判決を約束いたします。如何でしょうか？",
        "",
        "ch_10434/R18/10434A0_10434_Nml/10434A0_10434_002",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "カガミヤ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10434/R18/10434A0_10434_Nml/10434A0_10434_002"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "4a9b59d10a5de1ebc4f4546f6d34593545fbcf7bafc2feee00799bc0526407e8",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "言い争っていたふたりは、カガミヤさんに割り込まれる。\nだがその落ち着いた雰囲気を見てか、おとなしくなって頷いた。",
      "jp_sha256": "7e41050cb9e8ac270066b4bb3612ffb860a1e9b28210d0f0d5c7406cf765ace0",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "말다툼하던 두 사람 사이로 카가미야 씨가 끼어든다.\n하지만 그 차분한 분위기를 보고 얌전해졌는지 고개를 끄덕였다.",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 32,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e906b023611dfe70ce208122b4133c9bbe1f445607c1f7b2da358e2323e5e051:000002_5102256964758571102:g0:r31",
      "row_index_0based": 31,
      "serialized_row_index": 31,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "言い争っていたふたりは、カガミヤさんに割り込まれる。\nだがその落ち着いた雰囲気を見てか、おとなしくなって頷いた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "d4104c04bebe9dfa52f93bff2d6c6160841ed0070af1c97da1064a6ba46c18c7",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 5,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "す、すごい。\nあんなに険悪そうだったのに……！",
      "jp_sha256": "d7a1c259cf9fda0636dccc334887de506acbef77a24c14b31d9736660c32eeb6",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "대, 대단해.\n그렇게 험악해 보였는데……!",
      "message_index_0based": 5,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 34,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e906b023611dfe70ce208122b4133c9bbe1f445607c1f7b2da358e2323e5e051:000002_5102256964758571102:g0:r33",
      "row_index_0based": 33,
      "serialized_row_index": 33,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "す、すごい。\nあんなに険悪そうだったのに……！"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "61f8c5fdac623ca11f51fcd7dd1820908a8d28d648232920636af2e442cd9930",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 6,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "言い争っていたふたりから事情を聞いたカガミヤさんは、\n顎に指を添えながら、真剣な表情をする。",
      "jp_sha256": "abe653effdf0386f103db149b9d81c4ce0c275b272923cceec8926a656962b0c",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "다투던 두 사람에게 사정을 들은 카가미야 씨는,\n턱에 손가락을 대고 진지한 표정을 지었다.",
      "message_index_0based": 6,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 40,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e906b023611dfe70ce208122b4133c9bbe1f445607c1f7b2da358e2323e5e051:000002_5102256964758571102:g0:r39",
      "row_index_0based": 39,
      "serialized_row_index": 39,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "言い争っていたふたりから事情を聞いたカガミヤさんは、\n顎に指を添えながら、真剣な表情をする。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "f4fc17a584ca8fcdd26f503d446a0ca428ccb6f2de60260dfadc9feb2022b68b",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 7,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "なるほど。落ちていた１冊の本を、どちらが手に入れるか――。\nそれで争っていたわけですか。ふむ……難しいですね。",
      "jp_sha256": "3a328cab532fe54ffb9746eca11ae873eb76a8abb3398cde0009941aa060e8cb",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그렇군요. 떨어져 있던 책 한 권을 누가 가질지――.\n그걸로 다투고 있었습니까. 흐음…… 어렵군요.",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 41,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e906b023611dfe70ce208122b4133c9bbe1f445607c1f7b2da358e2323e5e051:000002_5102256964758571102:g0:r40",
      "row_index_0based": 40,
      "serialized_row_index": 40,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "カガミヤ",
        "Emt6_Sur",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "なるほど。落ちていた１冊の本を、どちらが手に入れるか――。\nそれで争っていたわけですか。ふむ……難しいですね。",
        "",
        "ch_10434/R18/10434A0_10434_Nml/10434A0_10434_003",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "カガミヤ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10434/R18/10434A0_10434_Nml/10434A0_10434_003"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "b3a994739c791884028ffc749d1fb3cd05dfbb6f9ebbd6b8c1c216ccc1406f52",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "私も中身を確認しないことには、判断ができません。\nその本をこちらに。……どうもありがとうございます。",
      "jp_sha256": "604aa48e7a321da4b7b17655da8218fa5eff05d5b767f0d70b86093ddd627da8",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "저도 내용을 확인하지 않고서는 판단할 수 없습니다.\n그 책을 이쪽으로. ……감사합니다.",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 42,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e906b023611dfe70ce208122b4133c9bbe1f445607c1f7b2da358e2323e5e051:000002_5102256964758571102:g0:r41",
      "row_index_0based": 41,
      "serialized_row_index": 41,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "カガミヤ",
        "Emt7_Ama",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "私も中身を確認しないことには、判断ができません。\nその本をこちらに。……どうもありがとうございます。",
        "",
        "ch_10434/R18/10434A0_10434_Nml/10434A0_10434_004",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "カガミヤ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10434/R18/10434A0_10434_Nml/10434A0_10434_004"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "f75361369398d1417a5f0abfddf71ae2f43ba55237a7321aca1b7c8ee7d1f082",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ふむ……。\nむ！　こ、これは……！　そういうことですか。\nうっ！？　なるほど……なるほど……！",
      "jp_sha256": "baf5c10257cb014e3e4c0ed79535d41a62e5231ab2f1aaa01315f501a0448eb4",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "흐음…….\n뭇! 이, 이건……! 그런 거였습니까.\n웃!? 그렇군요…… 그렇군요……!",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 44,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e906b023611dfe70ce208122b4133c9bbe1f445607c1f7b2da358e2323e5e051:000002_5102256964758571102:g0:r43",
      "row_index_0based": 43,
      "serialized_row_index": 43,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "カガミヤ",
        "Emt8_Shy",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "ふむ……。\nむ！　こ、これは……！　そういうことですか。\nうっ！？　なるほど……なるほど……！",
        "",
        "ch_10434/R18/10434A0_10434_Nml/10434A0_10434_005",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "カガミヤ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
