    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "b066a1d19b2a84087ae3b25252d0cf84ed290c782b02487f9a4b5e6e636a33de",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 17,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "おふたりは争いをやめ、手を取り合い、\n『モンスターなかよし』をしなさい。\n私はしっかりと、あなたたちを見ていますからね。",
      "jp_sha256": "cef34213f4d64e88939d3593dfecfcb91b2476b99015ec0984b96b03f0830471",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "두 분은 다툼을 멈추고 손을 맞잡아,\n‘몬스터 사이좋게 지내기’를 하십시오.\n제가 확실히 여러분을 지켜볼 테니까요.",
      "message_index_0based": 17,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 87,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e906b023611dfe70ce208122b4133c9bbe1f445607c1f7b2da358e2323e5e051:000002_5102256964758571102:g0:r86",
      "row_index_0based": 86,
      "serialized_row_index": 86,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "カガミヤ",
        "Emt3_Gla",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "おふたりは争いをやめ、手を取り合い、\n『モンスターなかよし』をしなさい。\n私はしっかりと、あなたたちを見ていますからね。",
        "",
        "ch_10434/R18/10434A0_10434_Nml/10434A0_10434_011",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "カガミヤ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
