    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "af421ade6506e3ee66b82e815b1cd05d302a1e9e45c51b7bb926f4a5f5bb0d6e",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 18,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ランシャンさんとトンジャオさんのふたりは、\nお互いの顔を見合わせると、手を繋ぎ、何処かへ去って行った。",
      "jp_sha256": "bb5a8ffb77a9389b860d0c080abf1b2fb1795e84ce3e272404c396802690aee7",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "란샹 씨와 톤자오 씨는,\n서로 얼굴을 마주 보더니 손을 잡고 어딘가로 떠났다.",
      "message_index_0based": 18,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 99,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e906b023611dfe70ce208122b4133c9bbe1f445607c1f7b2da358e2323e5e051:000002_5102256964758571102:g0:r98",
      "row_index_0based": 98,
      "serialized_row_index": 98,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ランシャンさんとトンジャオさんのふたりは、\nお互いの顔を見合わせると、手を繋ぎ、何処かへ去って行った。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "11b8b780596d8e9f1fdf2e3fc508d129a8a84097ec79ff2550915b3d4d5b9182",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 19,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ひひひ。チョロいもんだぜ。\nさてと、この本で日課の”お楽しみ”をしたあとは、\n鏡でふたりの様子を確認してと――。",
      "jp_sha256": "3a7dc541afc1d1b6f8b97577326802fed2c61e5ef6a21d0e3a3782bc7d596ee1",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "히히히. 참 쉽네.\n자, 이 책으로 일과인 ‘즐거운 시간’을 보낸 뒤,\n거울로 두 녀석 상태를 확인하고――.",
      "message_index_0based": 19,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 107,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e906b023611dfe70ce208122b4133c9bbe1f445607c1f7b2da358e2323e5e051:000002_5102256964758571102:g0:r106",
      "row_index_0based": 106,
      "serialized_row_index": 106,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "カガミヤ（鏡像）",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ひひひ。チョロいもんだぜ。\nさてと、この本で日課の”お楽しみ”をしたあとは、\n鏡でふたりの様子を確認してと――。",
        "",
        "ch_10434/R18/10434A0_10434_Nml/10434A0_10434_012"
      ],
      "speaker": "カガミヤ（鏡像）",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10434/R18/10434A0_10434_Nml/10434A0_10434_012"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "a4a46353aa13d45057fa6e0e79f4fecbf266bc0e70f3551e5c3cec5608a24553",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 20,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "カガミヤさん！　すごいですね！\nあのふたりを大人しくさせるなんて！",
      "jp_sha256": "cbef8d9a7a41b165efea8cf8a017d54f327713603f141e568b0e715d6e6172e6",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "카가미야 씨! 대단하네요!\n그 두 분을 얌전하게 만들다니!",
      "message_index_0based": 20,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 111,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e906b023611dfe70ce208122b4133c9bbe1f445607c1f7b2da358e2323e5e051:000002_5102256964758571102:g0:r110",
      "row_index_0based": 110,
      "serialized_row_index": 110,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "カガミヤさん！　すごいですね！\nあのふたりを大人しくさせるなんて！"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "11307255423f8b5b2e30a5c04b4589bd7ddea5b924f38da9ed2e79a97984d910",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 21,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あ、ご主人様。いらっしゃったのですか。\n……もしかして、見ていましたか？",
      "jp_sha256": "0759e858178c07c122f5dc659ea1974fc2bcb204903d3e00854de21f36dea94e",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아, 주인님. 계셨습니까.\n……설마 보고 계셨나요?",
      "message_index_0based": 21,
